<!DOCTYPE drumkv1>
<preset collection="Vee One Factory" autor="G3N-es" license="Creative Commons Zero (CC0) 1.0 Universal">
 <comments>
  CircuitShot is inspired by the sound of 80s analog drum machines.

  Combos:
  DrumkV1 allows multiple instances on the same track.
  You can combine this kit with 80sSampler and/or Chords_ElectricHit for an instant 80s vibe.

  Samples sourced from:
  SaikeDrum.
  40-Snare was layered with a snare generated with SynthV1.
 </comments>
